WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 013. THE MODEL IS ONE STAGE.. Consequence is produced by the full workflow around it.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
MAP THE HANDOFFS. INTAKE → DATA → MODEL → DECISION → ACTION. Add monitoring because the workflow does not end when an action ships.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
PLACE THE RISK. WHERE DOES IT ENTER?. Incorrect data, automation bias, and failed notice begin at different stages.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
TRACE THE PATH. WHAT CAN IT REACH?. A missing control becomes a condition inherited by downstream work.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
CONTROL EACH STAGE. OWNER · CONTROL · STOP · MONITOR. Every handoff needs accountable power—not a generic assurance statement.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. FOLLOW THE CONSEQUENCE THROUGH THE WORK.. A propagation score exposes gaps. It never approves deployment.

